#. module: ptplus_saft
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ptplus_saft.field_res_config_settings__l10n_pt_saft_computing_method
msgid ""
"The method used to compute the SAF-T elements. Possible values are:\n"
"* Real-time: elements are created, validated and cached while issuing, "
"making its extraction process extremely fast.\n"
"* Delayed: elements are created, validated and cached in batches \n"
"using cron tasks. The extraction process is as fast as in the Real-time \n"
"method and it doesn't slow down document issuing. It does however allow \n"
"documents to be issued without fully complying to the SAF-T rules which \n"
"means that the extraction process may require problem solving.\n"
msgstr ""

